## Verification Plan

### Automated
```
python manage.py check
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver  # verify no import errors
```

### Endpoint Tests
1. `POST /api/fingerprint/upload/` with a camera photo → expect `201 Created`, `minutiae_count > 5`
2. `POST /api/fingerprint/sensor-capture/` with sensor binary → expect match or no-match
3. `GET /api/students/<id>/` → verify `fingerprint_image_size = '400x500'` stored correctly
4. Inspect `captured_fingerprints/` directory — pipeline grid images should show v4 stages

### Re-enrollment Required
All existing students must re-enroll their fingerprints after the migration runs.
